# Theta Engine Mode C baselines

Locked short-only book is **`theta_engine_base`** (`workspace/strategies/theta_engine/base.py`). No cover, no long wings, no perps. Use display names — **not** "Sharpe" / "PnL". Policy IDs are stable; never rename.

Fork future versions from `base.py`. Do not start from v9 (still has trail/launch/`hedge_delta`) or from v12 (cover overlay).

| Display | Policy ID | Combo hash (v9 run 692) | Entry | TP |
|---------|-----------|-------------------------|-------|----|
| **RichForce16** | `fav_sharpe_rich4_f5_1600` | `863976b083ad` | rich-or-forced, VRP≥4 else force after 5d Mon/Thu @ 16:00 UTC | **0.60** |
| **Daily15** | `fav_pnl_daily_1500` | `0d32e43a12ab` | daily Mon–Fri clock @ 15:00 UTC (no VRP gate) | **0.50** |

Shared lock: `delta=0.25`, `min_dte=90`, `hold_days=0`, `stop_loss_pct=3.0`, `max_concurrent=20`, `qty_per_1btc_equity=0.2`. Skew6@14. DATE_RANGE `2025-04-11` → `2026-08-01`.

Constants: `workspace/strategies/theta_engine/_common.py` (`BASELINE_RICHFORCE16`, `BASELINE_DAILY15`, `BASELINE_DISPLAY`, `MODE_C_BOOK`, `MODE_C_TP`, `MODE_C_DATE_RANGE`).

v10/v11 forked these entries then added Greeks / sticky wings / perps — do not treat those as the Mode C lock.

`theta_engine_v12` is a `base` fork with a long-option **cover** overlay (`cover_*` knobs). No perps. Trigger = shorts-only D/G; size = full book D/G; vega is metered only.

`theta_engine_v13` is a `base` fork with a **paired far-OTM wing** on every short (`wing_strike_pct` / `wing_debit_pct` / `wing_expiry`). Strike is % of the short strike (put K×(1−pct), call K×(1+pct)); qty is % of short credit, floored at 0.1 and capped at short qty — no budget skips. Short stays the boss; TP/SL are short-leg only. Default `track_investor_greeks=1` meters shorts-only vs full-book D/G (vega is a meter, not a gate) into `investor_greeks.parquet`. v9 remains the historical run-692 artefact.

